 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Product Landing Pages, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a product landing page?\", \"a\": \"It is a standalone web page whose only job is selling one item to people who clicked a particular ad, email, or post. A product landing page leaves out the store menu and keeps a single action in view, which is adding that item to the cart. The photo, the price, and the Buy button usually fit on the first phone screen.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I build a product landing page that sells?\", \"a\": \"Begin with the ad that will send visitors, then describe the product, its price, and its variants. Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder'>AI landing page builder</a> turns that description into a live page, links the Buy button to the right cart variant, and saves which campaign sent each click. Test the page on a phone before the ad runs.\"},{\"q\": \"What's the difference between a landing page and a product page?\", \"a\": \"A product page lives inside a store, with menus and a cart for anything on the site. A landing page sells one product to one campaign's visitors and asks for one click. A store can run both, with the store page for browsers and the landing page for paid traffic.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are some single product landing page examples?\", \"a\": \"Think of a cast iron skillet sold from one ad, or a coffee subscription with one plan. Each of these pages carries a single item and a single Buy button. Sizes or colors are picked on the page itself, never on a separate catalog page.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find product landing page examples?\", \"a\": \"Landing page galleries such as Landingfolio collect live pages you can study side by side. Note where each one places the price and how far down the reviews start. Emergent can then build a page with that layout from a written description of your own product.\"}, {\"q\": \"What do the best product landing pages have in common?\", \"a\": \"The best product landing pages make one promise and hold it all the way down. The headline repeats the ad that brought the visitor, and the price is visible before any scrolling. Reviews sit close to the Buy button, where a hesitant shopper looks last.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is a product landing page template worth using?\", \"a\": \"Yes, for the layout, as long as every sample photo and line of filler copy gets swapped out. A product landing page template arrives without your photos and without a Buy button tied to a real cart variant. Emergent starts from a description instead, and on paid plans the finished code can go to your GitHub repository.\"}, {\"q\": \"How long should good product landing pages be?\", \"a\": \"Long enough to answer what a buyer asks before paying. A $15 phone case can sell on one screen with a short spec list. A $400 espresso machine needs its dimensions and warranty terms further down, plus a stack of reviews. However long the page runs, the price stays in the first screen next to the button.\"},{\"q\": \"What makes a good product landing page design?\", \"a\": \"Good product landing page design gets a phone visitor to the price without scrolling, then answers buyer questions below it. The page keeps one call to action from top to bottom. An <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/app-landing-page'>app landing page</a> follows the same rule, with a store badge where the Buy button would be.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can I make a product landing page for free?\", \"a\": \"Yes. Emergent is free to start, and the free tier covers building and publishing a product landing page; a custom domain uses credits. After an order, send buyers to a thank you page built the same way, with the order details and a next step.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
